## 🔹 DELETION in CLL

### 4️⃣ Delete at Beginning
```c
void deleteAtBeginning(struct Node** head) {
    if (*head == NULL) return;

    struct Node* temp = *head;

    if ((*head)->next == *head) {  // Only one node
        free(*head);
        *head = NULL;
        return;
    }

    struct Node* last = *head;
    while (last->next != *head) last = last->next;

    last->next = (*head)->next;
    *head = (*head)->next;
    free(temp);
}
```

